# DSS Project — GCP configuration override (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The project and bucket are already pre-configured in the scripts.
# You do NOT need this file to run the demo.
#
# Only create gcp.conf if you want to point the scripts at a
# different GCP project or bucket:
#
#   cp gcp.conf.template gcp.conf
#   # then edit gcp.conf with your own values
#
# gcp.conf is .gitignored — it stays on your machine only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GCP_PROJECT = your-project-id
# GCS_BUCKET  = gs://your-bucket-name
# GCP_REGION  = us-central1
